      "path": "sections/07_runtime_codesign.tex",
      "line": 22,
      "text": "A minimal path registry would associate each target execution setting with its qualification scope: model artifacts, runtime revision, numerical options, context/output conditions, and the evaluated workload. Selection would consider only paths admitted by the active contract. Changing the runtime, quantization, or execution shape would invalidate the relevant qualification rather than inherit it silently. This registry is proposed metadata and policy, not a claim that a finite test suite proves correctness for every possible input."
